 @seasesh4073  Nvidia can’t make them that much better, if the 3080ti was that much faster it would be faster then the 3090 and the 3070ti would be faster then the 3080.  Nvidia just didn’t have anywhere near the actual performance difference the price difference in their “tiers” of GPUs usually have.
