This is how capitalism works, how it's always worked. Nvidia has a responsibility, an actual legally bound one to it's stakeholders. Their #1 goal is to make money. The best thing you can do to protest Nvidia, is to buy AMD. But AMD also has that same legal and moral responsibility. 

That's how all business runs in this world. It's not some communist dream world where everything is equitable and fair.
